---
/** Homepage hero (§4.1). */
---
<section class="container-tg pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-24 md:pb-20">
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] gap-12 items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow mb-5">Founder · GAMEPLAN. · Performance, Media, Technology</p>
      <h1 class="text-balance">
        I help founders and fast-growth businesses win customers with performance marketing and AI.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-7 text-xl max-w-xl" style="color:#374151">
        15 years across Google, Meta and TikTok. £20m+ in paid media managed. Now building
        AI-first marketing systems through my consultancy, GAMEPLAN.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="/work-with-me" class="btn btn-ink">Work with me</a>
        <a href="/speaking" class="btn btn-powder">Book me to speak</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="order-first lg:order-last">
      <div class="aspect-[4/5] bg-grey-100 border border-grey-100 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center max-w-sm mx-auto lg:ml-auto">
        <!-- [TOM TO SUPPLY: headshot.webp, explicit dimensions] -->
        <div class="text-center p-8">
          <span class="display text-6xl font-bold text-powder-deep">TG</span>
          <span class="block text-grey-400 text-xs mt-3" style="color:#9ca3af">[TOM TO SUPPLY: headshot]</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
